==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*mysliti}}, from {{der|cs|ine-pro|*muHdʰ-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|cs|/ˈmɪslɛt/}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-myslet.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i}}

# to [[think]] {{gloss|to reckon, to estimate}}
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Myslím''', že to zvládneš.|I think you're going to make it.}}
# to [[think]] {{gloss|to think about}}
#: {{uxi|cs|Musel jsem na ni '''myslet''' celý den.|I had to think about her all day long.}}
# to [[mean]]
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Myslel''' jsem to metaforicky.|I meant it metaphorically.}}

